### Listar todos os serviços
GET {{BASE}}/servicos
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Listar serviços por área
GET {{BASE}}/servicos/area/2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Criar um novo serviço
POST {{BASE}}/servicos
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

{
    "area_id": "1",
    "nomeServico": "Corte de Cabelo Masculino",
    "duracao_min": "30",
    "preco": "25.00"
}

### Atualizar um serviço existente
PUT {{BASE}}/servicos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

{
    "area_id": "1",
    "nomeServico": "Unhas de Gel com Nail Art",
    "duracao_min": "30",
    "preco": "30.00"
}

### Atualizar um serviço inexistente
PUT {{BASE}}/servicos/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

{
    "area_id": "999",
    "nomeServico": "Serviço Inexistente",
    "duracao_min": "30",
    "preco": "30.00"
}

### Deletar um serviço
DELETE {{BASE}}/servicos/1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}

### Deletar um serviço inexistente
DELETE {{BASE}}/servicos/999
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{TOKEN}}